      "position": [
        208,
        -48
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "width": 480,
        "height": 736,
        "content": "# Borg Backup to Google Drive\n\nThis workflow creates a Borg backup of a server directory, compresses it, and uploads it to Google Drive.\n\n## Setup\n\n1. Connect your SSH and Google Drive credentials.\n2. Open **Get Backup Settings** and complete the form.\n3. Run the workflow once to save your configuration.\n4. Configure the Schedule Trigger for automatic backups.\n\n**Important:** The form only needs to be completed on the first run. After that, scheduled executions will use the saved configuration automatically.\n\n## Backup Modes\n\n• **Sync:** Keeps only the latest backup file.\n• **Versioned:** Creates a new timestamped backup on every run.\n\n\n💡 Tip\n\nThis form is publicly reachable with basic auth only.\nFor extra safety, consider publishing the workflow only\nwhen you need to submit the form, then unpublishing it\nright after."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "6b669878-ba2e-4d75-9d41-358ea7b206ef",
