      "parameters": {
        "width": 480,
        "height": 576,
        "content": "# Restore a Backup\n\n1. Download the backup archive from Google Drive.\n2. Extract the archive:\n```\ntar -xzf backup.tar.gz\n```\n\n3. List available archives:\n```\nborg list /path/to/repository\n```\n\n4. Restore an archive:\n```\nborg extract /path/to/repository::<archive-name>\n```\n\nFor more restore options and examples:\nhttps://borgbackup.readthedocs.io/en/stable/"
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
